#: ../../../release_notes.md:7
msgid ""
"The Gazebo team is happy to announce the 10th major release of Gazebo, code "
"named Jetty\\! Jetty is a long term support (LTS) release, meaning it has a "
"longer support lifetime, May 2031 to be exact."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_notes.md:11
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_notes.md:13
msgid "Here’s a brief summary of all the new features in Gazebo Jetty:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_notes.md:15
msgid "A new [Jetty Demo World](https://github.com/gazebosim/jetty_demo)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_notes.md:17
msgid ""
"We created a realistic warehouse environment designed to highlight the "
"latest Jetty features. This free, downloadable demo includes shelving and an "
"autonomous forklift for loading and unloading. As an added bonus, it also "
"features an [Open-RMF](https://www.open-rmf.org/) demonstration."
msgstr ""

